     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I am currently running daily assessments using mirtCAT and I want the script to show an additional block of items only on Sundays. Currently, I only pass one list of questions to mirtCAT: </div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Question</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> questions</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;slider&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pre</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">post</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">step</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mirtCAT_preamble</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyGUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">guiList</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div>But I don&#39;t know how to get mirtCAT to select another block of items when a certain condition is met.</div><div><br></div><div>Any advice on how to accomplish this is highly valued.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Tim</div><div><br></div></div>"
